                                   plugin, a user service serving http://127.0.0.1:7788 (and, with Tailscale,
                                   https://<machine>.<tailnet>.ts.net:7443 for the owner's own devices)
  sturnus token [--rotate]         the sign-in token every browser needs once (--rotate: a new one, all signed out)
  sturnus pair                     a code to pair the Sturnus phone app with this machine (also in Settings → Access)
  sturnus upgrade [--force] [--release]
                                   the newest version: a git clone it was installed from is pulled first; one installed
                                   from a release archive (or --release) takes the newest release on GitHub
  sturnus uninstall [--purge]      take everything out again (--purge: its settings and caches too)
  sturnus ls [--all]               the sessions: what each is called, its workspace, how it stands, its terminal
  sturnus open NUMBER|TITLE        this terminal goes to that session's terminal; a stopped one is given a new
